OL,3,GNEWSANurses vote for industrial action
OL,4,Aover pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FNurses in Northern Ireland have voted
OL,7,Foverwhelmingly to take industrial
OL,8,Faction, including strike action, over
OL,9,Fpay.
OL,11,FThey will take continuous action short
OL,12,Fof strike action from 3 December, with
OL,13,Fa date for full strike action to be
OL,14,Fconfirmed.
OL,16,FThe Royal College of Nursing (RCN) said
OL,17,Fthe action is the result of the failure
OL,18,Fof the Northern Ireland Executive and
OL,19,FDepartment of Health to implement the
OL,20,F2026-27 pay award.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
