OL,3,GNEWSANurses vote for industrial action
OL,4,Aover pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pay review body recommended a 3.3%
OL,7,Frise for Agenda for Change staff, which
OL,8,Fincludes nurses, health visitors,
OL,9,Fmidwives, ambulance staff, porters and
OL,10,Fcleaners, from April this year.
